# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
# Git stores text files with LF in the index; checkouts keep LF in the working tree.
# This stops core.autocrlf=true from rewriting every file on checkout, which made
# the whole working tree appear dirty and polluted real diffs.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the EOL normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.hdr binary
*.fbx binary
*.usdz binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.lock binary
